WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:39.800 --> 01:40.664
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:41.200 --> 01:47.064
=Episode 7=
(So, You Like Her?)

01:48.684 --> 01:49.204
Give me this.

01:50.845 --> 01:51.365
Come on.

02:02.925 --> 02:03.325
Brother.

02:03.445 --> 02:04.684
Is it a draw?

02:06.084 --> 02:07.644
It's a blunder.

02:07.845 --> 02:08.885
Ruled as an accident.

02:09.684 --> 02:11.005
She retains her position.

02:11.164 --> 02:11.925
The result's valid.

02:12.124 --> 02:12.444
So...

02:12.524 --> 02:14.044
So, she won?

02:24.327 --> 02:29.444
♪Like a gust of wind
floating across the sky♪

02:29.524 --> 02:30.244
I'll be gentle.

02:31.623 --> 02:36.589
♪It will erase the traces of regret♪

02:38.521 --> 02:41.765
♪How many sceneries have I passed by♪

02:41.845 --> 02:42.925
Do you have to work so hard

02:43.005 --> 02:44.005
for the prize money?

02:44.524 --> 02:45.684
That's 5,000.

02:46.204 --> 02:48.685
It's enough for me to travel
between Qingyi and Beijing.

02:48.765 --> 02:50.684
I'm serious. You take it seriously.

02:51.143 --> 02:53.991
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

02:54.392 --> 02:57.458
♪The moment I hug you♪

02:57.770 --> 03:05.400
♪Let every chapter of the story align♪

03:07.416 --> 03:10.503
♪Even if it rains on you♪

03:10.731 --> 03:14.128
♪I will always be with you♪

03:15.192 --> 03:18.544
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

03:18.744 --> 03:21.285
♪Our love will last♪

03:21.400 --> 03:24.555
♪Even if it rains on you♪

03:24.824 --> 03:27.004
♪I will always be with you♪

03:27.084 --> 03:27.564
Thank you.

03:29.144 --> 03:30.685
♪I will let you know♪

03:30.765 --> 03:31.845
Why are you here?

03:32.044 --> 03:33.164
I've been looking for you.

03:34.124 --> 03:34.644
What's wrong?

03:40.124 --> 03:41.044
Luzhou.

03:41.365 --> 03:42.124
This is for you.

03:43.325 --> 03:43.885
Okay.

03:44.485 --> 03:45.164
I have to go.

03:49.885 --> 03:50.684
Yan Letong's sister.

03:51.164 --> 03:52.124
She wanted ice cream.

03:54.325 --> 03:55.285
I also

03:55.365 --> 03:56.845
bought it for you.

03:58.765 --> 04:00.684
You're pretty close to her.

04:02.845 --> 04:04.925
Her ice cream cost 8,
while yours cost 80.

04:05.485 --> 04:06.405
So, who am I closer to?

04:06.965 --> 04:08.524
That's quite a simple way

04:09.044 --> 04:10.405
of measuring closeness.

04:10.925 --> 04:12.484
Between us, isn't it perfect

04:12.564 --> 04:13.885
to measure with money?

04:17.445 --> 04:18.485
If I pay you 5,000

04:19.005 --> 04:20.205
for your kiss,

04:20.285 --> 04:21.204
will you agree?

04:22.244 --> 04:23.325
If I hesitate for a second,

04:23.405 --> 04:25.124
it'll be disrespectful to the money.

04:29.885 --> 04:30.805
Four-leaf clover.

04:33.724 --> 04:34.485
Go ahead.

04:38.405 --> 04:39.405
I have to go.

04:41.445 --> 04:42.084
No, thanks.

04:42.564 --> 04:43.044
I'm leaving.

04:44.845 --> 04:45.365
By the way,

04:46.965 --> 04:48.044
(Four-leaf clover ice cream)
you owe me a joke.

05:02.684 --> 05:03.285
My idol.

05:03.684 --> 05:04.285
My idol.

05:06.805 --> 05:08.084
Didn't you go back to the hotel?

05:09.044 --> 05:10.044
I have something to do

05:10.644 --> 05:11.684
and will go back tonight.

05:11.805 --> 05:12.325
So,

05:12.684 --> 05:15.285
I specifically came
to take a photo with you.

05:24.724 --> 05:25.325
What's up?

05:27.365 --> 05:27.925
I'm sorry.

05:29.124 --> 05:29.564
What?

05:32.124 --> 05:33.765
I'm sorry, alright?

05:38.965 --> 05:39.965
Not arrogant now?

05:40.684 --> 05:41.445
You deserve it.

05:42.604 --> 05:43.204
What happened?

05:43.925 --> 05:45.044
Didn't Xu Zhi tell you?

05:46.885 --> 05:48.845
Just when you went out to meet someone,

05:49.124 --> 05:50.964
that guy badmouthed you.

05:51.044 --> 05:52.044
We heard it.

05:52.564 --> 05:54.325
He said you were arrogant and cocky.

05:54.524 --> 05:55.805
You even brought a girl here.

05:55.885 --> 05:57.285
You were dating here, not working.

05:57.445 --> 05:59.124
And your photography skills...

06:01.805 --> 06:03.204
Xu Zhi couldn't stand it anymore.

06:03.445 --> 06:04.805
She rebutted and started a game.

06:05.044 --> 06:07.124
If he loses,
he will lose his prize money

06:07.204 --> 06:08.124
and do one more thing.

06:09.604 --> 06:10.164
What is it?

06:10.724 --> 06:13.925
If you lose,
you'll apologize to Chen Luzhou.

06:15.604 --> 06:16.445
I have to go.

06:16.644 --> 06:17.365
See you.

06:30.823 --> 06:33.468
♪In the darkness, you're like fireworks♪

06:33.548 --> 06:36.325
♪Unattainable♪

06:36.718 --> 06:39.805
♪How much time is needed♪

06:39.885 --> 06:40.564
I need the loo.

06:40.644 --> 06:41.684
Okay, I'll wait here.

06:41.831 --> 06:44.599
♪To vividly sketch♪

06:46.724 --> 06:47.285
Hello?

06:47.724 --> 06:48.365
Got an umbrella?

06:48.644 --> 06:49.325
No.

06:49.464 --> 06:52.184
♪I want to understand your fragility♪

06:52.885 --> 06:55.124
How come it suddenly started to rain?

06:55.285 --> 06:55.965
In your bag.

06:56.359 --> 06:59.271
♪And you always have me♪

06:59.684 --> 07:00.965
How did you know?

07:01.244 --> 07:02.365
Didn't I tell you?

07:02.552 --> 07:04.084
I don't go out unless it rains.

07:04.792 --> 07:05.885
♪You will fulfill the past♪

07:05.965 --> 07:06.405
By the way.

07:06.485 --> 07:08.245
♪Dream you long for♪

07:08.325 --> 07:09.684
Lv Yang just apologized to me.

07:10.392 --> 07:10.968
Oh.

07:11.604 --> 07:12.445
Don't overthink it.

07:12.885 --> 07:14.765
Having him apologize was a side thing.

07:15.044 --> 07:16.845
The main thing was to get his bonus.

07:18.005 --> 07:18.365
Okay.

07:18.885 --> 07:20.084
Whatever you say.

07:20.327 --> 07:22.446
♪Ticking and tattling♪

07:22.596 --> 07:24.120
♪Who is worried♪

07:24.280 --> 07:27.805
♪I believe
you can't find a reason either♪

07:28.088 --> 07:31.256
♪Don't give it an answer♪

07:36.204 --> 07:36.885
Lv Yang

07:37.485 --> 07:38.604
(Lounge)
just threw a tantrum here.

07:39.365 --> 07:41.044
Losing to Xu Zhi in front of

07:41.124 --> 07:42.044
so many people

07:42.204 --> 07:43.164
is a big blow to him.

07:43.765 --> 07:44.925
He will be upset for a while.

08:01.204 --> 08:03.604
You said Xu Zhi rarely lost her temper.

08:03.845 --> 08:05.524
I thought she was a gentle girl.

08:05.805 --> 08:06.885
But today,

08:07.244 --> 08:08.325
I realize she's not.

08:09.223 --> 08:11.608
(Ready For a New Ride)

08:12.164 --> 08:13.044
Well,

08:13.204 --> 08:14.684
he kicked me.

08:16.005 --> 08:17.965
His shoe soles are so clean.

08:18.164 --> 08:20.124
They didn't leave a mark
on your white pants.

08:20.685 --> 08:21.725
What do you mean?

08:21.965 --> 08:22.805
I recorded it.

08:22.885 --> 08:24.204
Let me send it to you.

08:24.725 --> 08:27.284
You should get it down to written form

08:27.885 --> 08:28.725
to avoid any default.

08:42.599 --> 08:48.415
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

08:48.967 --> 08:51.244
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

08:51.324 --> 08:52.445
(Chen Luzhou)
(I can answer)

08:52.525 --> 08:53.284
(your questions.)

08:55.204 --> 08:56.845
(If the walls in my heart collapse,)

08:57.404 --> 08:59.885
(I'll build an even stronger fortress.)

09:01.885 --> 09:03.845
(If all the rivers in the world dry up,)

09:04.725 --> 09:06.725
(I will melt glaciers with my tears.)

09:09.244 --> 09:10.845
(If the sun no longer rises,)

09:11.565 --> 09:13.565
(I will try to light all the lamps.)

09:15.175 --> 09:19.765
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

09:19.845 --> 09:22.164
(Whether the moon is full or not,
it doesn't matter.)

09:23.084 --> 09:24.525
(I will always be there for you.)

09:25.095 --> 09:30.415
♪Into concern and care♪

09:34.514 --> 09:35.943
(Retract)

09:35.943 --> 09:41.055
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

09:41.575 --> 09:47.415
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

09:48.871 --> 09:51.284
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

09:51.364 --> 09:52.444
(I'm inspired.)

09:53.124 --> 09:55.725
(But what is the last message)

09:56.204 --> 09:56.965
(you retracted?)

09:57.444 --> 09:59.484
(Just made it up. Never mind it.)

09:59.719 --> 10:01.944
♪The lonely clock♪

10:02.151 --> 10:06.751
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

10:07.143 --> 10:10.391
♪Are we both♪

10:10.663 --> 10:13.565
♪We approach each other♪

10:13.645 --> 10:16.044
Chen Luzhou.

10:16.124 --> 10:21.951
♪No backing down, oh oh oh♪

10:30.823 --> 10:33.560
(2016 MtoGD Bisco Grand Prix)

10:33.725 --> 10:34.296
Luzhou.

10:36.124 --> 10:37.044
You have no umbrella?

10:37.525 --> 10:38.084
It's okay.

10:38.805 --> 10:39.685
I'm so glad

10:39.805 --> 10:41.645
to make friends with you.

10:42.164 --> 10:43.204
I have good judgment.

10:43.484 --> 10:45.364
You have a bright future ahead.

10:46.444 --> 10:47.164
This is for you.

10:48.965 --> 10:49.605
Thanks.

10:50.525 --> 10:52.005
Another one is for Xu Zhi.

10:52.364 --> 10:53.605
Her apexing impressed me.

10:55.832 --> 10:57.016
Don't keep it for yourself.

10:57.204 --> 10:59.084
Rest assured, I'll give it to her.

10:59.685 --> 11:01.364
Buddy, you're very lucky.

11:01.965 --> 11:03.605
This is a helmet with an autograph

11:03.805 --> 11:05.084
of the future Grand Slam player.

11:05.324 --> 11:06.244
Keep it well.

11:06.885 --> 11:08.164
It will be very valuable.

11:08.845 --> 11:09.404
Okay.

11:10.525 --> 11:10.965
See you.

11:18.404 --> 11:19.164
Yan Letong.

11:19.645 --> 11:20.765
Wait for me.

11:21.284 --> 11:21.845
Come on.

11:24.124 --> 11:25.685
Luzhou, goodbye.

11:39.444 --> 11:41.084
(If the walls in my heart collapse,)

11:41.525 --> 11:43.725
(I'll build an even stronger fortress.)

11:45.044 --> 11:47.204
(Xu Zhi's Moments)
(If all the rivers in the world dry up,)

11:47.645 --> 11:49.885
(I will melt glaciers with my tears.)

11:51.204 --> 11:52.885
(If the sun no longer rises,)

11:53.444 --> 11:56.324
(I will try to light all the lamps.)

12:03.324 --> 12:03.965
Zhi.

12:04.605 --> 12:05.685
What did you post?

12:05.885 --> 12:07.284
It's profound, I can't understand.

12:07.605 --> 12:08.084
It's okay.

12:08.404 --> 12:09.965
I'll give you a dictionary later.

12:11.324 --> 12:11.885
Come on.

12:14.284 --> 12:15.725
(I don't read much. Can't get it.)

12:16.284 --> 12:17.645
Even Stylish Zhu can't understand.

12:18.444 --> 12:19.324
Let me reply to him.

12:20.765 --> 12:22.084
(Being uncultured is not scary.)

12:22.645 --> 12:24.484
(I'll give you a dictionary later.)

12:25.124 --> 12:25.725
Look.

12:36.484 --> 12:38.484
(Very good and positive.)

12:51.965 --> 12:54.005
(Cai Yingying)
(My first business failed.)

12:56.605 --> 12:58.284
Why is Feng Jin with them?

13:00.324 --> 13:01.244
Linshi?

13:02.484 --> 13:04.005
Lucy is also in Linshi.

13:06.765 --> 13:08.244
You're isolating me, aren't you?

13:08.725 --> 13:09.965
You wish.

13:24.925 --> 13:26.005
She's a star.

13:26.685 --> 13:27.925
I heard there was a crew

13:28.005 --> 13:28.765
in this hotel.

13:28.845 --> 13:29.685
Turns out it's true.

13:38.965 --> 13:40.124
Hello, check in.

13:40.845 --> 13:41.605
Hello, sir.

13:41.685 --> 13:43.645
Is your room booked with the crew?

13:45.044 --> 13:46.084
Okay, wait a moment.

13:47.879 --> 13:53.816
(Welcome the crew to stay)

14:06.364 --> 14:07.484
Why are you here?

14:09.525 --> 14:10.404
Doing post-production.

14:11.364 --> 14:11.965
You going out?

14:12.805 --> 14:13.084
Yes.

14:13.645 --> 14:15.084
Yingying ate too much last night.

14:15.164 --> 14:16.605
I'm going to buy digestive pills.

14:18.204 --> 14:19.044
How is your leg?

14:20.765 --> 14:21.565
It doesn't hurt now.

14:21.885 --> 14:23.204
Just a bit bruised.

14:26.565 --> 14:27.765
Why don't you come up with me?

14:27.885 --> 14:29.204
I have digestive pills.

14:29.725 --> 14:30.845
And I'll give you something.

14:31.204 --> 14:31.805
Okay.

14:54.605 --> 14:55.244
You go in first.

15:05.685 --> 15:06.244
Thank you.

15:08.685 --> 15:09.324
And this.

15:10.005 --> 15:11.284
Yan Letong got this for you.

15:11.645 --> 15:13.284
He said your apexing impressed him.

15:15.565 --> 15:16.444
This is...

15:16.925 --> 15:17.885
He asked me to tell you

15:17.965 --> 15:20.525
that it's a signature
from a future Grand Slam champion.

15:22.044 --> 15:22.645
Alright.

15:24.565 --> 15:26.124
In this aspect of narcissism,

15:26.204 --> 15:27.404
you've met your match.

15:31.244 --> 15:32.484
You have nothing else to say?

15:33.845 --> 15:34.685
What else?

15:35.805 --> 15:36.965
(I mean the promised joke.)

15:37.525 --> 15:38.525
Never mind.

15:39.164 --> 15:39.805
And this.

15:40.005 --> 15:41.164
I bought it on the way.

15:41.284 --> 15:42.645
Remember to use it.

15:44.324 --> 15:45.525
Thank you.

15:49.765 --> 15:50.805
Are you paying me again?

15:55.284 --> 15:57.044
If you do it again, we'll be strangers.

15:58.204 --> 15:59.765
Why are you angry again?

16:00.765 --> 16:02.685
It's not good for your health.

16:03.645 --> 16:05.965
Then reflect on it,
and stop making me angry, okay?

16:06.685 --> 16:08.484
Could you consider my feelings?

16:08.725 --> 16:09.965
I took you to my workplace.

16:10.084 --> 16:11.765
If something happened when you raced,

16:11.845 --> 16:12.685
your dad

16:12.765 --> 16:13.965
and Mr. Fu would kill me.

16:14.204 --> 16:15.404
So, you're upset about this?

16:15.805 --> 16:17.124
You don't have to worry at all.

16:17.925 --> 16:19.805
If my dad finds out I crash my bike,

16:20.084 --> 16:21.725
he'll definitely think I deserve it.

16:21.805 --> 16:23.605
Then he'll take me to his hospital.

16:24.124 --> 16:25.765
Mr. Fu will not blame you.

16:26.124 --> 16:27.404
In his eyes,

16:27.605 --> 16:30.004
you have to crash before you become

16:30.084 --> 16:30.925
a professional.

16:32.124 --> 16:32.725
It happened?

16:33.484 --> 16:33.965
Yeah.

16:34.444 --> 16:35.565
When he took me

16:35.645 --> 16:37.044
for a ride in the practice field,

16:37.284 --> 16:38.885
I didn't do the apexing properly

16:39.005 --> 16:40.005
and directly fell.

16:40.364 --> 16:41.725
Luckily, it was not serious.

16:42.805 --> 16:44.685
But my knee was hurt,

16:45.484 --> 16:46.484
which led to arthritis.

16:47.204 --> 16:48.885
It hurts on rainy days.

16:49.044 --> 16:50.084
It even creaks.

16:50.725 --> 16:52.364
That's why I hate going out
on rainy days.

16:53.404 --> 16:54.204
Listen.

16:55.605 --> 16:56.765
Are you proud of it?

16:57.444 --> 16:57.965
No.

16:58.605 --> 16:59.605
Don't people always say

17:00.124 --> 17:02.364
that what doesn't kill you
makes you stronger?

17:02.845 --> 17:03.925
That was kind of a brush

17:04.005 --> 17:05.605
with death, right?

17:06.005 --> 17:07.404
I'll definitely succeed.

17:12.284 --> 17:13.484
Are you still angry?

17:16.725 --> 17:17.484
How about

17:18.404 --> 17:19.685
I owe you another joke?

17:20.645 --> 17:21.765
I owe you two jokes then.

17:22.124 --> 17:22.765
What do you say?

17:25.444 --> 17:25.965
You remember?

17:26.845 --> 17:27.484
Of course.

17:29.124 --> 17:30.124
I'll tell you one joke.

17:30.645 --> 17:31.084
Okay.

17:34.124 --> 17:35.364
Actually, it's not a real joke.

17:35.444 --> 17:36.765
It's something new.

17:37.284 --> 17:38.925
And it can also serve as a reminder.

17:39.525 --> 17:40.685
My dad met a hot guy

17:40.765 --> 17:41.805
in his department.

17:42.244 --> 17:43.445
A very handsome boy.

17:43.525 --> 17:45.324
But he's not very healthy.

17:46.124 --> 17:47.284
He denied it.

17:47.725 --> 17:48.925
He couldn't complete a test.

17:49.124 --> 17:51.324
It's common among the young people.

17:51.565 --> 17:54.525
They have bad habits, like smoking,
staying up late, and drinking.

17:55.364 --> 17:58.488
The survival rate of reproductive cells
is less than 30 percent.

17:58.845 --> 17:59.404
Scary, right?

18:03.164 --> 18:04.845
Your dad is an andrologist?

18:09.605 --> 18:11.164
Chen Luzhou, right?

18:20.244 --> 18:20.965
What's wrong?

18:21.765 --> 18:22.605
Are you thirsty?

18:23.124 --> 18:23.805
I'm not.

18:24.885 --> 18:26.005
What else did your dad say?

18:27.765 --> 18:28.605
What else?

18:31.965 --> 18:32.444
He said,

18:34.244 --> 18:36.004
"Zhi, when you have a boyfriend,"

18:36.084 --> 18:37.845
"remember to take him for a check-up."

18:43.685 --> 18:44.525
What's wrong?

18:48.484 --> 18:49.845
Why are you nervous?

18:49.925 --> 18:50.845
You're disciplined.

18:50.925 --> 18:52.324
I don't think you have problems.

18:54.084 --> 18:55.845
Of course, I don't have those problems.

19:02.885 --> 19:03.525
Thank you.

19:07.885 --> 19:08.925
Wasn't it funny?

19:10.685 --> 19:11.565
I'll tell another one.

19:11.885 --> 19:12.484
No need.

19:12.845 --> 19:13.805
It was funny. Thank you.

19:24.645 --> 19:25.725
Anyway,

19:26.204 --> 19:27.284
be careful.

19:27.845 --> 19:28.725
Don't get hurt again.

19:29.044 --> 19:30.204
If people like Lv Yang

19:30.404 --> 19:31.885
break their promise

19:32.005 --> 19:33.164
and pester you, what then?

19:34.284 --> 19:35.364
I'll call security.

19:35.685 --> 19:36.404
Security guards

19:36.484 --> 19:38.164
will come in handy, right?

19:41.725 --> 19:42.324
Who is it?

19:42.805 --> 19:43.284
No idea.

19:54.244 --> 19:56.164
Could you tell me
which room Chen Luzhou is in?

19:56.284 --> 19:57.164
CLZ.

19:57.444 --> 19:58.845
Sorry, but I'm afraid I can't help.

19:58.925 --> 19:59.565
Just checked in.

19:59.645 --> 20:00.725
You can call your friend.

20:00.805 --> 20:01.284
Yingying?

20:02.565 --> 20:04.164
Zhu Yangqi, what are you doing here?

20:04.444 --> 20:06.164
All of you came to Linshi.

20:06.244 --> 20:06.845
Can't I come?

20:07.084 --> 20:07.885
I'm here for Lucy.

20:08.484 --> 20:09.885
Lucy? Chen Luzhou?

20:10.164 --> 20:11.005
He lives here too?

20:11.244 --> 20:12.525
Yes, he just checked in.

20:13.284 --> 20:15.124
Though I've called him for half an hour,

20:15.204 --> 20:15.805
no answer.

20:15.885 --> 20:17.525
She won't tell me which room he's in.

20:17.645 --> 20:18.364
Zhu Yangqi.

20:19.244 --> 20:19.685
Come here.

20:19.765 --> 20:20.364
Gu Yan?

20:20.765 --> 20:21.565
Why are you here?

20:22.364 --> 20:23.324
Something happened.

20:25.005 --> 20:25.725
What happened?

20:26.244 --> 20:26.485
Look.

20:26.565 --> 20:27.284
You guys go.

20:27.484 --> 20:27.845
Okay.

20:30.324 --> 20:31.364
I've already explained it.

20:32.525 --> 20:33.885
My room was booked by the team.

20:33.885 --> 20:35.645
The reception asked
if I was with the crew.

20:35.645 --> 20:37.324
I thought it was the crew
of the car team.

20:38.885 --> 20:40.284
Sounds like a real story.

20:41.204 --> 20:42.204
You're lying.

20:42.525 --> 20:43.725
I'll call the police.

20:47.845 --> 20:48.765
Mr. Xu, it's a mistake.

20:48.845 --> 20:49.885
She's that star.

20:50.284 --> 20:52.005
He's my classmate,
a high school graduate.

20:52.565 --> 20:53.765
He's not a paparazzo.

20:54.124 --> 20:56.364
The equipment of high school graduates

20:56.444 --> 20:57.364
is that professional?

20:58.324 --> 20:59.404
He likes photography.

20:59.605 --> 21:00.685
His parents support him.

21:01.364 --> 21:03.404
His mom is a producer
at our city's TV station.

21:04.124 --> 21:05.765
His dad is the boss of Bohui Studios.

21:06.525 --> 21:08.324
So, he absolutely can't be a paparazzo.

21:09.885 --> 21:11.044
It is a misunderstanding.

21:11.364 --> 21:13.525
The security guards
take it too seriously.

21:14.444 --> 21:16.084
Sorry about that.

21:16.525 --> 21:17.164
It's a mistake.

21:18.925 --> 21:20.364
It's okay. They're friends.

21:20.444 --> 21:21.084
It's a mistake.

21:21.244 --> 21:23.124
Send my best to your dad.

21:24.484 --> 21:25.244
Thank you.

21:27.845 --> 21:29.005
You should thank Chen Luzhou.

21:30.925 --> 21:31.885
I'm here to help him.

21:36.444 --> 21:37.885
The air is tense.

21:39.204 --> 21:39.565
Well,

21:40.364 --> 21:41.244
we'll go buy drinks.

21:41.364 --> 21:41.925
You guys talk.

21:42.925 --> 21:43.484
See you.

21:47.605 --> 21:49.084
What's the relationship between

21:49.164 --> 21:50.124
those two?

21:50.204 --> 21:51.244
She's like his simp.

21:52.244 --> 21:53.404
You can see it.

21:53.525 --> 21:54.525
She really likes him.

21:54.645 --> 21:55.765
She's crazy about him.

21:58.484 --> 21:59.525
Do you have a girlfriend?

22:02.484 --> 22:03.005
No.

22:05.484 --> 22:06.725
I really miss you.

22:07.164 --> 22:08.565
Are you still mad at me?

22:09.044 --> 22:09.765
Chen Luzhou.

22:10.284 --> 22:12.005
I'm crazy about you.

22:13.208 --> 22:14.444
She's not my girlfriend.

22:16.885 --> 22:18.044
(So, it was her.)

22:19.164 --> 22:20.525
Is Chen Luzhou

22:20.605 --> 22:21.965
a playboy?

22:22.965 --> 22:24.164
No, he's not.

22:24.444 --> 22:26.005
Those girls have a crush on him,

22:26.364 --> 22:28.284
but Lucy has been single since birth.

22:29.244 --> 22:29.765
Zhi.

22:30.244 --> 22:31.284
Don't worry.

22:32.124 --> 22:33.364
What do I have to worry about?

22:34.044 --> 22:35.284
It has nothing to do with me.

22:40.084 --> 22:41.484
If Lucy hears this,

22:41.645 --> 22:42.525
his heart will hurt.

22:49.404 --> 22:50.164
Lucy.

22:53.324 --> 22:54.284
Where is Gu Yan?

22:55.204 --> 22:55.885
Back on set.

22:57.044 --> 22:58.645
We bought her milk tea.

22:58.925 --> 22:59.885
You drink it.

23:00.005 --> 23:00.605
Don't waste it.

23:00.805 --> 23:01.845
You bought it for her?

23:02.244 --> 23:02.685
Yeah.

23:03.525 --> 23:04.244
She helped us.

23:04.805 --> 23:05.284
Shouldn't I

23:06.244 --> 23:07.164
do this?

23:10.204 --> 23:11.284
You're so generous.

23:14.765 --> 23:15.244
Look,

23:15.845 --> 23:16.445
how about

23:16.525 --> 23:17.725
we eat hot pot tomorrow?

23:17.965 --> 23:19.164
Tomorrow? No.

23:19.284 --> 23:20.765
Zhi and I will visit a temple.

23:21.444 --> 23:23.404
We gained nothing on this trip.

23:23.484 --> 23:25.164
We need to find a way
to change our luck.

23:25.765 --> 23:27.124
And I will pray for good grades.

23:27.645 --> 23:28.925
There's a Nanyin Temple nearby.

23:29.124 --> 23:29.925
It's effective.

23:30.204 --> 23:31.404
Do you want to go with us?

23:32.805 --> 23:33.725
I have to work.

23:34.525 --> 23:35.044
I won't go.

23:37.364 --> 23:38.885
Let's meet again in Qingyi.

23:40.484 --> 23:41.765
Why is he mad again?

23:42.685 --> 23:43.364
I don't know.

23:46.965 --> 23:47.444
Let's go.

23:57.223 --> 24:04.152
(Welcome the crew to stay)

24:23.484 --> 24:24.364
(I just helped you.)

24:24.792 --> 24:25.925
(How will you thank me?)

24:26.765 --> 24:28.044
When you return to Qingyi,

24:28.605 --> 24:30.244
Xu Zhi and I will treat you to a meal.

24:31.044 --> 24:31.845
Xu Zhi?

24:32.685 --> 24:33.645
The girl with you?

24:36.084 --> 24:37.484
Do you have to invite her?

24:38.124 --> 24:39.244
Can't you and I eat alone?

24:39.525 --> 24:40.044
No.

24:41.005 --> 24:41.565
Why?

24:41.965 --> 24:43.044
You helped her and me.

24:43.204 --> 24:44.605
We both have to treat you together.

24:46.364 --> 24:47.885
So, you like her?

24:52.364 --> 24:53.124
Got it.

24:54.805 --> 24:55.885
Does she like you?

25:00.525 --> 25:01.725
That's none of your business.

25:24.005 --> 25:24.565
Dad.

25:25.404 --> 25:26.324
You're back.

25:29.805 --> 25:30.925
It smells so good.

25:32.005 --> 25:33.685
Can you tell what it is by the smell?

25:34.845 --> 25:35.525
It's love.

25:39.605 --> 25:40.284
Are you tired?

25:40.525 --> 25:41.484
What do you think?

25:43.284 --> 25:45.605
Congratulations to you
on the failure of the startup

25:45.685 --> 25:46.805
and returning in defeat.

25:47.444 --> 25:49.124
How could you be so mean?

25:51.124 --> 25:52.484
I'm encouraging you.

25:53.005 --> 25:54.204
You're only 18, right?

25:54.364 --> 25:55.845
You have a long road ahead.

25:55.925 --> 25:57.004
Failing now means

25:57.084 --> 25:58.725
that you're about to succeed.

25:59.005 --> 26:01.244
(Gardenia Doesn't Want to Bloom)
(Who's tricking Zhi?)

26:02.965 --> 26:05.204
(Some people are deceitful, you know.)

26:06.885 --> 26:07.685
(I made a mistake.)

26:18.725 --> 26:19.164
What?

26:19.685 --> 26:20.364
There's this.

26:21.725 --> 26:22.244
Say it.

26:23.645 --> 26:25.044
If I pray to a child-giving god,

26:25.124 --> 26:26.084
will it be an issue?

26:29.605 --> 26:30.404
If this

26:30.484 --> 26:32.484
is related to Chen Luzhou,

26:32.765 --> 26:33.685
it'll be an issue.

26:35.324 --> 26:37.124
How do you know it's related to him?

26:37.645 --> 26:38.965
(Dan's Snack)
Sir, pan-fried buns.

26:39.925 --> 26:41.404
Come on in and sit down.

26:41.925 --> 26:43.084
Here's a side dish

26:43.324 --> 26:43.965
for you.

26:44.284 --> 26:45.044
Thank you.

26:45.124 --> 26:45.965
You're new here.

26:46.284 --> 26:47.765
Here's a souvenir for you.

26:47.845 --> 26:48.404
Dan.

26:49.084 --> 26:49.525
Dan.

26:49.885 --> 26:51.324
Two more bottles of beer.

26:51.805 --> 26:52.645
You two.

26:57.084 --> 26:58.324
You're not

26:58.805 --> 27:00.484
working tomorrow? Drinking so much.

27:00.725 --> 27:01.485
It's not much.

27:01.565 --> 27:02.525
It's only six bottles.

27:02.765 --> 27:03.404
Alright.

27:03.484 --> 27:04.805
Don't get drunk.

27:04.965 --> 27:05.284
Okay.

27:05.965 --> 27:06.725
Join us later.

27:06.805 --> 27:07.645
Alright, no problem.

27:09.925 --> 27:10.685
So,

27:11.845 --> 27:13.845
Chen Luzhou

27:13.925 --> 27:15.124
is so bad, right?

27:16.725 --> 27:18.044
Whether he is or not,

27:18.244 --> 27:18.965
tell me one thing.

27:19.645 --> 27:22.005
What did Zhi say?

27:22.364 --> 27:23.324
She said

27:24.845 --> 27:26.284
she did it willingly.

27:29.364 --> 27:30.164
Whether

27:30.565 --> 27:31.124
she did it

27:31.204 --> 27:31.765
willingly

27:31.965 --> 27:32.925
or not,

27:33.805 --> 27:35.645
isn't Xu Zhi too young

27:35.725 --> 27:37.404
for this?

27:37.484 --> 27:38.204
So,

27:38.765 --> 27:40.324
I just

27:40.404 --> 27:41.645
grabbed a knife.

27:43.284 --> 27:44.605
Did he go to Linshi with you?

27:45.525 --> 27:46.725
Why did you hide it from me?

27:47.044 --> 27:47.725
No.

27:48.805 --> 27:49.845
Mr. Fu gave him a job,

27:49.925 --> 27:51.124
filming for a car team.

27:51.404 --> 27:53.084
He happened to be in Linshi.

27:53.805 --> 27:55.284
If you don't believe it, ask Mr. Fu.

27:55.845 --> 27:56.725
Don't mention him.

27:56.845 --> 27:57.765
Tell me

27:58.204 --> 27:58.965
about the god.

28:00.565 --> 28:01.725
Here's the thing.

28:02.005 --> 28:03.084
Yingying and I

28:03.244 --> 28:04.525
wanted to pray for good grades.

28:04.885 --> 28:06.164
Chen Luzhou

28:06.404 --> 28:07.404
mentioned a temple.

28:07.565 --> 28:08.364
So, we went there.

28:08.525 --> 28:10.244
Turns out it's a child-giving god.

28:10.805 --> 28:11.725
We made a blunder.

28:12.925 --> 28:14.044
That's it?

28:14.805 --> 28:15.484
Nothing else

28:15.965 --> 28:16.765
about it?

28:17.204 --> 28:17.645
Nope.

28:18.284 --> 28:18.925
Good.

28:21.084 --> 28:21.765
So,

28:22.885 --> 28:25.484
isn't Chen Luzhou bad?

28:26.484 --> 28:29.525
Can't you say it all at once?

28:29.765 --> 28:31.765
You just made me worried.

28:32.685 --> 28:34.124
Alright, isn't this just fine?

28:35.005 --> 28:36.124
Anyway,

28:36.565 --> 28:39.324
it's not what we thought.

28:39.484 --> 28:41.204
Of course, it's not.

28:41.645 --> 28:43.364
If it is,

28:43.685 --> 28:44.845
I'll kill him.

28:45.565 --> 28:45.965
Well,

28:46.725 --> 28:47.845
don't worry then.

28:50.484 --> 28:51.885
Zhi used to talk about everything

28:51.965 --> 28:53.204
with me.

28:53.484 --> 28:55.605
Now, every time I ask her
about Chen Luzhou,

28:56.404 --> 28:57.605
she changes the topic.

28:59.965 --> 29:00.484
Oh no.

29:00.965 --> 29:01.885
It's not good.

29:02.324 --> 29:03.645
There must be something fishy.

29:04.965 --> 29:06.484
But if they really get together,

29:06.685 --> 29:08.444
you should take extra precautions

29:09.044 --> 29:09.965
early.

29:10.925 --> 29:11.765
If they are

29:12.885 --> 29:14.404
in a serious relationship,

29:15.044 --> 29:16.044
it's okay.

29:17.244 --> 29:19.565
If Chen Luzhou

29:20.725 --> 29:22.244
cheats on Zhi,

29:24.925 --> 29:25.685
I will...

29:28.965 --> 29:29.765
Can you do that?

29:41.565 --> 29:43.244
(He's young after all.)

29:43.484 --> 29:46.164
(He's very healthy.)

29:48.005 --> 29:49.005
Dr. Xu.

29:51.525 --> 29:52.005
I...

29:52.364 --> 29:53.685
The indices

29:54.565 --> 29:55.525
are all fine.

29:56.244 --> 29:56.885
Very good.

29:57.484 --> 29:58.284
You're healthy.

29:59.284 --> 30:00.484
Even so,

30:01.244 --> 30:02.565
take care of your health.

30:03.084 --> 30:04.725
You're young and vigorous,

30:05.005 --> 30:06.965
but don't act recklessly.

30:07.484 --> 30:08.685
Be restrained

30:09.164 --> 30:10.404
sometimes.

30:10.484 --> 30:11.364
I am still a virgin.

30:12.805 --> 30:13.765
What's wrong with you?

30:14.645 --> 30:15.685
I didn't ask you that.

30:17.005 --> 30:17.925
That's it.

30:18.324 --> 30:19.005
You can leave.

30:19.124 --> 30:19.565
Okay.

30:21.685 --> 30:22.044
Wait.

30:23.444 --> 30:24.525
I'll show you something.

30:27.685 --> 30:28.565
Is this yours?

30:29.763 --> 30:31.445
(Dr. Xu, it's a thank-you gift.)

30:31.525 --> 30:32.885
You already know

30:33.605 --> 30:34.925
how to buy a doctor off, huh?

30:35.005 --> 30:35.964
(Zhu Yangqi, you fool.)

30:36.044 --> 30:36.805
Guess what this is?

30:37.525 --> 30:39.164
This is bribery.

30:40.444 --> 30:41.965
Sorry. There won't be a next time.

30:42.204 --> 30:43.284
No next time.

30:43.965 --> 30:46.925
Go to the discipline office
on the fifth floor.

30:47.685 --> 30:48.685
And take it back.

30:49.725 --> 30:50.525
Goodbye, Dr. Xu.

30:52.965 --> 30:54.965
What a troublesome boy.

30:56.324 --> 30:58.084
Number 134.

30:58.484 --> 31:00.244
Please proceed to the andrology room.

31:02.164 --> 31:02.725
How did it go?

31:03.164 --> 31:04.204
Did you manage

31:04.284 --> 31:05.965
to change your image in front of Dr. Xu?

31:06.084 --> 31:07.164
If you didn't mess it up,

31:07.244 --> 31:08.284
I'd almost make it.

31:08.605 --> 31:10.044
I told you not to give money.

31:10.605 --> 31:10.965
I...

31:12.244 --> 31:14.124
I thought he was asking you for that.

31:14.965 --> 31:16.525
Wait, I'll go explain.

31:16.725 --> 31:17.324
Stop it.

31:17.885 --> 31:19.284
Don't go. You'll get things worse.

31:22.164 --> 31:22.885
Does Xu Zhi know

31:23.805 --> 31:25.005
about your check-up?

31:25.805 --> 31:27.164
She probably doesn't.

31:28.044 --> 31:29.164
Has she contacted you?

31:29.925 --> 31:30.605
No.

31:31.605 --> 31:31.885
Hey,

31:32.084 --> 31:33.204
did you upset her?

31:33.484 --> 31:35.084
Why hasn't she replied your comments?

31:35.525 --> 31:36.204
Wait a moment.

31:36.805 --> 31:37.204
Hello?

31:37.965 --> 31:38.444
Basketball?

31:40.244 --> 31:42.044
No. Lucy is injured and can't play.

31:43.565 --> 31:44.605
Send me the address.

31:46.124 --> 31:47.124
Are you still playing?

31:47.204 --> 31:48.124
No trauma now?

31:48.765 --> 31:49.805
Dr. Xu said

31:49.885 --> 31:52.044
I need a re-examination next month.

31:52.284 --> 31:53.204
Rehabilitation.

31:56.204 --> 31:57.645
They really said so?

32:00.204 --> 32:01.204
So, I advise you

32:01.605 --> 32:02.685
to watch your language

32:03.005 --> 32:04.404
in front of your patients.

32:04.565 --> 32:05.565
Don't make them

32:06.204 --> 32:06.965
overthink.

32:08.005 --> 32:08.965
Indeed,

32:10.404 --> 32:10.964
I was wrong.

32:11.044 --> 32:12.885
Back then, all I was thinking about

32:12.965 --> 32:14.484
was Zhi.

32:14.885 --> 32:15.605
So, I just asked

32:16.645 --> 32:17.444
more questions.

32:17.925 --> 32:19.204
I understand.

32:19.685 --> 32:20.324
Well,

32:20.965 --> 32:22.805
did you ask your future son-in-law

32:23.005 --> 32:24.164
what his family does?

32:25.124 --> 32:26.845
His family does business...

32:29.005 --> 32:30.044
Future son-in-law?

32:32.845 --> 32:33.925
Don't have my tea.

32:34.324 --> 32:34.685
What?

32:35.484 --> 32:36.484
Are you speaking for him?

32:36.725 --> 32:37.805
No, I'm not.

32:38.005 --> 32:38.965
I mean, what if

32:39.204 --> 32:40.124
you misunderstood him?

32:40.404 --> 32:42.364
What if he's a nice guy?

32:43.404 --> 32:45.685
The red envelope
was indeed a misunderstanding.

32:45.765 --> 32:47.885
But I still have to test him.

32:48.244 --> 32:48.965
For example,

32:49.404 --> 32:51.244
I must give him a whole check-up.

32:51.925 --> 32:53.605
He must be a healthy person.

32:54.805 --> 32:55.444
How about this?

32:55.565 --> 32:56.925
After you check him,

32:57.005 --> 32:57.565
my turn.

32:57.645 --> 32:59.044
I'll check his eyes.

32:59.484 --> 33:00.484
His eyes are pretty good.

33:00.845 --> 33:03.084
He definitely likes Zhi at first sight.

33:03.204 --> 33:04.845
His vision is definitely fine.

33:06.605 --> 33:09.005
Could you switch to better tea?

33:09.204 --> 33:09.725
I'm leaving.

33:11.244 --> 33:12.244
You can give me good tea.

33:13.685 --> 33:14.925
Let's eat together later.

33:20.805 --> 33:21.565
Isn't it good?

33:23.525 --> 33:23.965
- Go.
- Ok.

33:27.005 --> 33:27.885
Let's go for it.

33:30.044 --> 33:31.124
Who's that? Never seen him.

33:31.404 --> 33:32.925
He's a newcomer.

33:33.484 --> 33:34.244
Go easy.

33:34.885 --> 33:35.284
Come on.

33:35.444 --> 33:36.484
- Come on.
- Start it.

33:36.965 --> 33:37.525
- Come.
- Go.

33:45.725 --> 33:46.765
Pretty good, huh?

33:47.084 --> 33:47.965
Of course.

33:48.244 --> 33:50.084
He's from the school team.
You're no match.

33:58.885 --> 33:59.685
Come on. Let go.

34:22.925 --> 34:23.404
Good shot.

34:24.765 --> 34:25.845
- Nice.
- Good shot.

34:32.525 --> 34:33.965
Why is he so good?

34:35.244 --> 34:36.284
Play harder later.

34:36.805 --> 34:37.885
You changed your mind?

34:37.965 --> 34:39.005
You told me to go easy.

34:40.204 --> 34:41.324
The situation has changed.

34:42.084 --> 34:44.044
A man can be killed but not humiliated.

34:45.204 --> 34:46.565
I'm here for rehabilitation.

34:47.525 --> 34:49.005
I'm not a sidekick,

34:49.525 --> 34:50.925
and you're not my boss.

34:51.685 --> 34:52.845
Come on.

34:55.084 --> 34:56.364
If I'm not your boss, who then?

34:56.444 --> 34:56.925
Xu Zhi?

34:57.364 --> 34:58.805
I don't think she wants to be.

34:59.124 --> 34:59.845
You want a fight?

35:02.084 --> 35:03.404
I won't team up with Zhu Yangqi.

35:03.484 --> 35:04.725
Change teams, four against two.

35:04.805 --> 35:05.565
No, no change.

35:05.845 --> 35:06.685
Come on.

35:07.605 --> 35:08.164
You play hard,

35:08.484 --> 35:09.965
and I'll tell you where Xu Zhi is.

35:12.364 --> 35:13.005
Who cares?

35:14.885 --> 35:15.605
Second round.

35:18.525 --> 35:19.164
Come on.

35:19.925 --> 35:20.605
Restart it.

35:23.284 --> 35:23.965
Come on!

35:24.124 --> 35:24.725
First serve.

35:24.805 --> 35:25.284
Start.

35:25.765 --> 35:26.404
Defend.

35:28.685 --> 35:29.404
Defend.

35:30.404 --> 35:31.324
Come on!

35:31.404 --> 35:33.124
- Nice shot.
- Nice.

35:34.204 --> 35:35.404
It's okay. Block him.

35:35.525 --> 35:35.925
Watch him.

35:37.444 --> 35:37.845
Lucy.

35:41.044 --> 35:41.765
Nice shot.

35:43.685 --> 35:44.444
It's okay. Again.

35:50.925 --> 35:51.364
Defend.

36:02.204 --> 36:02.605
Try again.

36:02.805 --> 36:03.284
Keep up.

36:05.044 --> 36:05.645
Lucy, catch it.

36:09.124 --> 36:09.725
Keep it up.

36:15.444 --> 36:16.204
What's going on?

36:16.284 --> 36:17.324
You said four against two.

36:17.404 --> 36:18.404
Don't be a fence-sitter.

36:18.525 --> 36:19.044
Sorry.

36:19.525 --> 36:20.645
Yangqi knows my weakness.

36:20.725 --> 36:22.284
We'll crush him one day.

36:23.284 --> 36:24.005
Lucy, catch it.

36:31.484 --> 36:32.204
Keep it up.

36:39.645 --> 36:42.164
- Nice shot.
- Good.

36:42.965 --> 36:44.324
Luzhou, here's your water.

36:45.525 --> 36:46.204
Thank you.

36:51.044 --> 36:52.084
Two Americanos.

36:54.565 --> 36:55.525
Want a screen protector?

36:56.164 --> 36:57.685
Do you want a manicure, Miss?

36:57.965 --> 36:58.404
No.

36:58.484 --> 36:59.525
Want a screen protector?

36:59.965 --> 37:01.005
No.

37:04.204 --> 37:05.445
(Manicure and Flowers)
It's been several days.

37:05.525 --> 37:06.605
Yet very few customers.

37:07.284 --> 37:09.164
Can we make money this way?

37:09.685 --> 37:10.485
I don't know.

37:10.565 --> 37:12.605
But at least we earn money
with a clear conscience.

37:12.685 --> 37:13.444
We're not cheating.

37:14.244 --> 37:16.885
But we're doing such a small business.

37:17.124 --> 37:18.284
When can we

37:18.364 --> 37:19.404
make a big fortune?

37:20.645 --> 37:21.324
I think

37:21.404 --> 37:23.284
we can make
a small fortune for milk tea.

37:23.512 --> 37:27.672
(Phone Screen Protector)

37:27.765 --> 37:29.164
How about we learn photography?

37:29.605 --> 37:30.885
Maybe we can make good money

37:30.965 --> 37:31.605
like Luzhou.

37:33.484 --> 37:35.685
Don't you think
photography costs a lot of money?

37:36.164 --> 37:37.204
We can't even afford

37:37.284 --> 37:38.885
a lens with all the money we have.

37:40.324 --> 37:41.725
Then I should do my small business.

37:43.204 --> 37:45.044
What has Chen Luzhou been up to?

37:46.124 --> 37:47.485
Probably preparing papers

37:47.565 --> 37:48.845
for going abroad.

37:49.404 --> 37:51.324
He commented on your Moments.

37:51.404 --> 37:52.404
Yet you didn't reply.

37:53.284 --> 37:55.444
Because he sent me
to the child-giving god.

37:56.885 --> 37:57.765
I need to bench him.

38:00.725 --> 38:02.485
Zhi, I'm going to buy a cup of milk tea.

38:02.565 --> 38:03.324
You watch my stand.

38:07.605 --> 38:08.364
Have a look.

38:10.965 --> 38:11.565
Look.

38:12.765 --> 38:14.164
Life is like flower seeds.

38:14.685 --> 38:16.364
It doesn't have to grow into a rose.

38:16.645 --> 38:18.725
Sunflowers can also
have their own pride.

38:19.005 --> 38:21.284
As long as the goal is the same,

38:21.444 --> 38:22.605
once you quit your job,

38:22.725 --> 38:24.404
we will start a happy family.

38:24.765 --> 38:25.044
Okay.

38:28.364 --> 38:29.765
They are rose seeds.

38:30.124 --> 38:31.685
They will eventually grow into roses.

38:31.965 --> 38:32.685
Come on.

38:33.005 --> 38:34.925
Can you be a bit logical
about your promises?

38:35.124 --> 38:36.044
What do you mean?

38:36.124 --> 38:36.925
You know it.

38:37.044 --> 38:38.605
Could you play some new tricks?

38:39.044 --> 38:40.925
You've come many times
in the past few days.

38:41.005 --> 38:42.444
Always with a different girl.

38:43.204 --> 38:45.725
You created a poem to rose seeds

38:46.364 --> 38:48.084
and tricked them
into being full-time wives.

38:48.164 --> 38:49.284
It was so cringy.

38:49.725 --> 38:50.805
No, listen to me.

38:52.444 --> 38:53.164
Keyi.

38:54.965 --> 38:55.925
What's wrong with you?

38:56.845 --> 38:58.484
I can smash your stand.

39:13.364 --> 39:14.124
Who are you?

39:14.204 --> 39:15.284
It's none of your business.

39:15.925 --> 39:16.845
I'm her customer.

39:17.404 --> 39:18.444
It's my business.

39:21.645 --> 39:22.364
Hey, man.

39:23.164 --> 39:24.244
This is a nail salon.

39:25.084 --> 39:27.124
What's wrong? Can't I have a hobby?

39:33.925 --> 39:34.645
Be creative.

39:35.284 --> 39:36.725
Iron Man or Spider-Man is fine.

39:37.925 --> 39:39.005
The Hulk is not okay.

39:42.925 --> 39:43.484
Still here?

39:44.084 --> 39:45.444
Waiting for a fight or the police?

39:49.284 --> 39:50.885
I'm going.

39:56.685 --> 39:57.685
Wait, it'll be done soon.

39:58.284 --> 39:59.525
Are you serious?

40:00.284 --> 40:01.484
Isn't this what you asked for?

40:03.084 --> 40:05.164
You're biting the hand that feeds?

40:05.885 --> 40:06.645
No.

40:07.284 --> 40:08.404
Just let me do this.

40:08.484 --> 40:09.565
You're my first customer.

40:09.645 --> 40:10.324
I'll do one nail.

40:10.565 --> 40:11.324
Want rhinestones?

40:11.805 --> 40:13.565
And this one is very beautiful.

40:21.444 --> 40:23.204
A freshman girl got plastic surgery

40:23.324 --> 40:24.525
for her lover but was scammed.

40:25.005 --> 40:26.885
She was even despised by her boyfriend.

40:28.005 --> 40:29.484
Who wrote this article?

40:32.364 --> 40:33.565
I've seen the original draft.

40:34.244 --> 40:35.525
That girl had plastic surgery

40:35.725 --> 40:37.084
to participate in a competition.

40:37.404 --> 40:39.124
It has nothing to do with her boyfriend.

40:39.805 --> 40:41.284
Why did you rewrite it like this?

40:41.725 --> 40:42.885
To catch people's attention?

40:43.204 --> 40:44.324
Sorry, Hui.

40:44.605 --> 40:46.204
What era are we in now?

40:46.685 --> 40:48.324
Stop writing about girls

40:48.444 --> 40:50.324
doing everything for men.

40:50.805 --> 40:51.885
Guess why I brought you

40:51.965 --> 40:52.765
here?

40:52.845 --> 40:53.925
Let you find the news peg.

40:54.005 --> 40:55.284
Come on. Follow me.

40:55.885 --> 40:57.725
You're here to do some field research.

40:57.925 --> 40:59.725
Many cases and news stories

40:59.885 --> 41:02.645
are born out of people's lives.

41:03.495 --> 41:08.692
♪Like a gust of wind
floating across the sky♪

41:10.791 --> 41:15.757
♪It will erase the traces of regret♪

41:17.689 --> 41:23.544
♪How many sceneries have I passed by♪

41:24.437 --> 41:29.577
♪Waiting for a meeting♪

41:30.311 --> 41:33.159
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

41:33.560 --> 41:36.626
♪The moment I hug you♪

41:36.805 --> 41:38.324
Is your mom busy lately?

41:40.084 --> 41:41.725
So, you still want to meet my mom, huh?

41:42.845 --> 41:43.885
Can't I?

41:45.124 --> 41:45.685
Yes.

41:47.565 --> 41:49.484
If you were my girlfriend, I'd help you

41:50.685 --> 41:52.565
see anyone, let alone my mom.

41:54.360 --> 41:57.712
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

41:57.965 --> 41:58.565
Zhi.

41:59.005 --> 42:00.005
Here's your milk tea.

42:00.284 --> 42:01.164
You're back.

42:01.324 --> 42:01.725
Thank you.

42:01.805 --> 42:02.444
Cai Yingying.

42:03.084 --> 42:03.925
Chen Luzhou?

42:04.484 --> 42:05.404
Why are you here?

42:06.605 --> 42:08.364
Zhu Yangqi said you guys are

42:08.444 --> 42:09.364
setting up stalls here.

42:09.565 --> 42:10.404
I'm her customer now.

42:11.484 --> 42:13.364
You're so nice.

42:16.124 --> 42:17.364
Since you're here,

42:17.685 --> 42:19.605
can you be my customer?

42:20.164 --> 42:21.164
What do you do?

42:21.404 --> 42:22.324
Screen protectors.

42:23.444 --> 42:24.845
I've never put it on my phone.

42:26.805 --> 42:28.084
Your phone is beautiful.

42:28.204 --> 42:29.525
It deserves a screen protector.

42:31.005 --> 42:31.965
I can't believe this.

42:33.484 --> 42:35.164
Alright, do it.

42:35.805 --> 42:37.084
Okay, one customer.

42:39.124 --> 42:40.645
Heat it for a while.

42:43.565 --> 42:44.925
You make full use of things.

42:45.244 --> 42:47.284
You won't pack up
until you drain me dry, right?

42:47.645 --> 42:48.965
I learned it from you.

42:49.324 --> 42:50.765
The child-giving god.

42:50.845 --> 42:52.324
I haven't made you pay for that yet.

42:52.685 --> 42:53.725
Child-giving god?

42:53.925 --> 42:56.244
Don't you know the Nanyin Temple
has a child-giving god?

42:57.005 --> 42:57.725
I don't know.

43:01.284 --> 43:02.925
That's why you didn't reply to me?

43:08.645 --> 43:10.164
I'll tell you a joke to cheer you up?

43:10.284 --> 43:11.725
Don't trouble yourself, sir.

43:17.845 --> 43:19.324
Everyone should watch closely.

43:19.685 --> 43:20.885
News is all around us,

43:21.084 --> 43:22.084
waiting to be found.

43:22.605 --> 43:25.204
Open your eyes and look.

43:27.765 --> 43:28.404
Hui,

43:29.324 --> 43:30.685
this is newsworthy.

43:31.645 --> 43:34.164
A cool guy is actually doing a manicure
on the street

43:34.244 --> 43:35.445
to please a girl.

43:35.525 --> 43:36.164
What do you say?

43:36.845 --> 43:37.645
Take a picture.

43:48.765 --> 43:50.364
I heard that someone across the street

43:50.484 --> 43:51.244
bit a dog.

43:51.525 --> 43:52.044
No.

43:52.765 --> 43:53.805
The dog bit the person.

43:54.044 --> 43:55.084
Go take a look.

43:55.204 --> 43:56.364
It must be newsworthy.

43:56.484 --> 43:56.765
Okay.

43:56.845 --> 43:57.605
Go and find out.

43:57.685 --> 43:58.965
- Alright.
- Come on.

44:31.096 --> 44:34.417
(If the sun no longer rises,)

44:34.791 --> 44:44.153
(I will try to light all the lamps.)

44:45.544 --> 44:51.360
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

44:51.912 --> 44:57.440
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

44:58.952 --> 45:03.400
♪The world is too quiet♪

45:04.392 --> 45:11.320
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

45:12.232 --> 45:17.320
♪Who will visit me♪

45:18.376 --> 45:24.000
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

45:24.744 --> 45:27.800
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

45:28.040 --> 45:33.360
♪Into concern and care♪

45:38.888 --> 45:44.000
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

45:44.520 --> 45:50.360
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

45:51.816 --> 45:55.200
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

45:55.336 --> 46:01.560
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:02.056 --> 46:05.000
♪The lonely clock♪

46:05.160 --> 46:09.760
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

46:10.152 --> 46:13.400
♪Are we both♪

46:13.672 --> 46:17.200
♪Attracted to each other♪

46:18.344 --> 46:24.960
♪Falling into you♪

46:28.680 --> 46:34.480
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:35.336 --> 46:38.000
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

46:38.536 --> 46:43.160
♪From reaching eternity♪

46:43.560 --> 46:46.840
♪After rushing recklessly♪

46:47.048 --> 46:50.480
♪We approach each other♪

46:51.752 --> 46:55.360
♪Without turning back♪

46:56.744 --> 47:04.400
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

47:05.032 --> 47:11.520
♪Falling into you♪
